=== Semi-log justification: logit with utility linear in price gives elasticity beta p (1 - s); the pure exponential is the s -> 0 limit. At share s the elasticity rises slower than e p / p_ref by the factor (1 - s)/(1 - s_ref).
research note 5.6 premise: 'Central (E = -0.4): revenue rises monotonically through plausible price ranges' -- under the configured form revenue peaks at p_ref/|e|: ccc $10.00, sweep $5.00 (e=-0.4) / $2.86 (e=-0.7).
